WEBVTT

01:25.870 --> 01:31.580
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.569
[Episode 25 Lingyuan in the Martial World]

01:46.810 --> 01:48.260
- Captain.
- Captain.

01:51.110 --> 01:53.210
Did you hear anything just now?

01:57.250 --> 01:58.366
Captain,

01:58.390 --> 01:59.886
we made 7,000 taels last night.

01:59.910 --> 02:00.826
How much more do we need?

02:00.850 --> 02:02.016
More than 50,000 taels.

02:02.040 --> 02:03.546
Even if we don't sleep day and night,

02:03.570 --> 02:05.020
we still need four or five days.

02:05.220 --> 02:06.670
Operate for one more day.

02:07.050 --> 02:09.509
Sink the rest of the official ingots tomorrow.

02:09.710 --> 02:10.146
Captain,

02:10.170 --> 02:11.050
what about Young Master?

02:11.070 --> 02:12.600
I'll handle it.

02:12.690 --> 02:14.590
Captain, a lot of boats are here.

02:21.600 --> 02:22.886
Lousy officials!

02:22.910 --> 02:24.146
Captain, run! We'll cover you!

02:24.170 --> 02:24.866
Yeah Captain!

02:24.890 --> 02:25.686
We'll stay here.

02:25.710 --> 02:27.136
Captain, please hide out.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.356
If worst comes to worst, it's just dying.

02:28.380 --> 02:29.386
If we let Captain risk your life,

02:29.410 --> 02:30.326
what's the point of having us?

02:30.350 --> 02:31.800
Please leave!

02:37.420 --> 02:38.870
Captain!

02:41.960 --> 02:43.096
Brothers.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.650
See you in the underworld!

02:46.390 --> 02:47.676
Defend on the upper deck!

02:47.700 --> 02:48.886
Life and death won't matter anymore!

02:48.910 --> 02:50.440
Hurry! Hurry!

02:50.900 --> 02:52.350
Hurry up!

02:55.120 --> 02:55.870
What should we do?

02:55.890 --> 02:57.086
Run!

02:57.110 --> 02:59.230
Hurry! Run!

03:04.650 --> 03:06.370
Go! Run!

03:07.170 --> 03:09.380
Kill all the bandits of Lingyuan Sect!

03:34.030 --> 03:34.606
My lord.

03:34.630 --> 03:36.080
I found a secret cabin.

03:48.480 --> 03:49.930
Come.

03:49.980 --> 03:51.430
Surrender!

03:55.810 --> 03:57.260
Please spare our lives, my lord.

04:31.700 --> 04:33.340
Get out of the way!

04:33.950 --> 04:36.275
Did you see a soaking wet thief passing by?

04:36.299 --> 04:36.896
No.

04:36.920 --> 04:38.370
Let's go.

04:55.870 --> 04:56.686
Sir.

04:56.710 --> 04:58.016
We searched along the river.

04:58.040 --> 04:59.640
No trace of the thief.

04:59.720 --> 05:01.406
You tracked him all the way up here.

05:01.430 --> 05:02.186
Yesm my lord.

05:02.210 --> 05:04.316
We've blocked the street as you ordered.

05:04.340 --> 05:05.970
This is the only way out.

05:07.880 --> 05:10.270
[Code]

05:32.990 --> 05:33.966
Uncle,

05:33.990 --> 05:36.140
are you sure he came here?

05:48.280 --> 05:49.706
The bandit of Lingyuan Sect.

05:49.730 --> 05:51.530
Where are you going?

05:53.410 --> 05:54.860
That one didn't turn around.

05:55.400 --> 05:56.850
Over there.

05:56.910 --> 05:58.046
It's him.

05:58.070 --> 05:59.520
After him!

06:04.540 --> 06:05.990
Out of the way!

06:21.530 --> 06:22.980
You traitor!

06:23.340 --> 06:26.340
If you surrender, you won't need to suffer.

06:30.990 --> 06:32.440
Wait for me here.

06:39.140 --> 06:42.470
You're the head bandit of Lingyuan Sect in Nandu.

06:42.580 --> 06:43.836
Tell me the truth.

06:43.860 --> 06:46.000
You bunch of hypocritical thieves

06:46.090 --> 06:47.866
will be overthrown someday.

06:47.890 --> 06:50.196
You've gained substantial power in Nandu.

06:50.220 --> 06:52.540
You must've secretly developed for many years.

06:53.549 --> 06:55.306
Why did you suddenly rob the official boat?

06:55.330 --> 06:58.450
You'll face the death penalty just for money.

06:59.190 --> 07:02.056
To this point, why don't you tell me the truth?

07:02.080 --> 07:03.786
I have the power

07:03.810 --> 07:05.590
to keep you alive.

07:16.460 --> 07:17.910
Open your mouth.

07:31.030 --> 07:32.980
He hid poison in his mouth.

07:44.790 --> 07:46.430
Take the body back.

07:46.510 --> 07:47.960
Yes, my lord.

07:48.150 --> 07:49.600
Guards!

07:54.850 --> 07:55.846
Princess.

07:55.870 --> 07:58.380
They don't care about their lives?

08:06.300 --> 08:07.750
Princess,

08:07.880 --> 08:09.820
don't mind this rascal.

08:10.210 --> 08:12.780
You must be tired after staying up all night.

08:13.650 --> 08:15.100
Li Bo,

08:19.040 --> 08:20.860
take the Princess back to rest.

08:21.670 --> 08:23.120
Yes, my lord.

08:38.179 --> 08:39.629
This way please.

08:39.850 --> 08:42.850
[Liansheng House]

08:42.939 --> 08:44.389
How is it?

08:46.960 --> 08:48.970
The pleasure boat was attacked by soldiers.

08:49.710 --> 08:51.616
If Miss Shu hadn't reminded us in time,

08:51.640 --> 08:55.130
I'm afraid we would already be in prison.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.446
Senior.

09:07.470 --> 09:08.230
I used to be against Miss Shu...

09:08.230 --> 09:11.206
Is Mr. Mo in Guanghui Bank?

09:11.230 --> 09:12.046
Yes.

09:12.070 --> 09:13.580
Take me to see him.

09:32.670 --> 09:35.020
Where is Mr. Yun going?

09:38.450 --> 09:40.490
I don't know where he's going.

09:42.470 --> 09:44.060
I'll be back in my room.

10:02.190 --> 10:03.640
Senior.

10:03.900 --> 10:06.566
I've been annoyed since Mr. Mo returned.

10:06.590 --> 10:08.646
If we get into an argument later,

10:08.670 --> 10:10.120
please don't blame me.

10:10.380 --> 10:11.830
It's okay.

10:17.410 --> 10:19.206
Is there a shadowman following us?

10:19.230 --> 10:20.680
Yes.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.690
Please give the order

10:23.080 --> 10:25.260
to spy on Shu Yanan.

10:25.340 --> 10:27.600
Are you mad at me for suspecting Miss Shu?

10:31.890 --> 10:33.370
Perhaps in this world,

10:34.200 --> 10:35.960
nobody can be trusted.

10:39.070 --> 10:40.520
Understood.

10:40.970 --> 10:42.420
Thank you.

10:56.970 --> 10:58.156
What are you doing?

10:58.180 --> 11:00.956
Your injury isn't healed and you're still drinking.

11:00.980 --> 11:02.966
Who will take care of you for the rest of your life?

11:02.990 --> 11:04.440
Don't worry.

11:04.900 --> 11:06.646
I don't have much time left.

11:06.670 --> 11:07.596
Give it to me.

11:07.620 --> 11:09.910
Watch it.

11:09.960 --> 11:10.986
It's expensive.

11:11.010 --> 11:12.790
It costs 100,000 taels.

11:18.020 --> 11:20.100
A pot of wine worth 100,000 taels.

11:21.190 --> 11:22.640
Mr. Mo,

11:23.270 --> 11:26.340
why don't you share it with everyone?

11:31.710 --> 11:33.776
You were unjustly imprisoned

11:33.800 --> 11:35.636
and thus suffered a lot because of me.

11:35.660 --> 11:39.350
Now I caused the bank to lose half of its silver taels.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.690
It's all my fault.

11:42.010 --> 11:45.050
I'll show my apology with this cup of wine.

12:16.260 --> 12:17.880
Enough.

12:20.960 --> 12:22.530
My wine is expensive.

12:26.710 --> 12:28.076
Forget it.

12:28.100 --> 12:29.826
It's just 100,000 taels.

12:29.850 --> 12:31.330
We can earn more after losing them.

12:32.950 --> 12:34.490
I'm not blaming you.

12:34.800 --> 12:36.676
I just can't accept the fact.

12:36.700 --> 12:38.440
So what?

12:38.700 --> 12:40.346
Liu Gongquan has the reputation.

12:40.370 --> 12:41.526
From his perspective,

12:41.550 --> 12:43.526
both Yuntai and Lingyuan

12:43.550 --> 12:45.076
are the enemies of the imperial court.

12:45.100 --> 12:46.880
He's already targeting us.

12:47.300 --> 12:48.870
What's the point of hiding now?

12:49.710 --> 12:51.160
It doesn't matter.

12:51.570 --> 12:53.630
Now we only need a bait

12:54.680 --> 12:56.990
to distract the Detective of Jiangnan.

12:57.110 --> 13:00.110
Bait? What bait?

13:01.300 --> 13:02.750
I...

13:10.650 --> 13:12.490
Don't look at me like that.

13:13.120 --> 13:15.520
I would never sacrifice myself for others.

13:15.940 --> 13:18.550
The Detective of Jiangnan suddenly came to Nandu.

13:18.700 --> 13:20.386
Although it may cause trouble,

13:20.410 --> 13:23.470
but it also brings variables.

13:23.620 --> 13:25.630
All things in the world

13:25.660 --> 13:27.386
rely on variables.

13:27.410 --> 13:30.060
Variables create opportunities.

13:30.230 --> 13:31.646
It's even too late to hide.

13:31.670 --> 13:33.420
Why do you want to get into trouble?

13:35.190 --> 13:36.640
Go on.

13:37.260 --> 13:39.180
There are still many uncertainties

13:39.350 --> 13:41.670
in the water ghost robbery case.

13:42.020 --> 13:43.530
I'm here

13:43.700 --> 13:46.670
to find out the truth with you.

13:49.250 --> 13:54.970
[Jishan Hall]

14:16.870 --> 14:18.166
Han Zi said,

14:18.190 --> 14:19.980
Confucianism disrupts the law with literature,

14:20.020 --> 14:21.820
whilst soldiers break the rules with weapons.

14:22.290 --> 14:23.980
Both acts are inappropriate.

14:24.160 --> 14:27.320
However, scholars are still highly reputed.

14:28.230 --> 14:29.146
Although the acts of Youxia may not fully

14:29.170 --> 14:31.786
embody the principles of justice,

14:31.810 --> 14:34.376
one must keep his words and actions.

14:34.400 --> 14:35.596
I've made my promise.

14:35.620 --> 14:36.876
I rather sacrifice myself

14:36.900 --> 14:39.130
and protect others from danger.

14:40.810 --> 14:42.260
Sister.

14:47.720 --> 14:49.170
Have you been a good girl?

15:05.870 --> 15:07.980
I see there are two more children.

15:08.300 --> 15:10.440
Jin found a new clue.

15:11.050 --> 15:13.926
He helped to pull some strings

15:13.950 --> 15:15.876
and asked someone to search in Yangzhou.

15:15.900 --> 15:18.610
They were redeemed from a restaurant.

15:18.710 --> 15:20.496
We have more evidence now.

15:20.520 --> 15:22.116
Let's follow this lead.

15:22.140 --> 15:24.626
I think we'll find the rest of the children soon.

15:24.650 --> 15:28.580
I'll call you Warrior Su from now on.

15:30.930 --> 15:33.290
You learned a lot from one lesson.

15:33.700 --> 15:36.590
I think you have the talent to be a teacher.

15:36.830 --> 15:39.420
Brother Su is a good teacher.

15:40.270 --> 15:41.536
I can't.

15:41.560 --> 15:43.400
You're little troublemakers.

15:43.870 --> 15:45.846
I've found a proper teacher.

15:45.870 --> 15:47.320
He'll be here in a few days.

15:48.830 --> 15:50.736
Aren't you producing the tributary cloth?

15:50.760 --> 15:52.530
Why do you have time to come here?

15:53.270 --> 15:54.816
Everything is ready over there.

15:54.840 --> 15:56.126
I don't have to make it myself anyway.

15:56.150 --> 15:58.226
Why didn't you visit Liansheng House?

15:58.250 --> 15:59.526
I'm not going there.

15:59.550 --> 16:02.180
Yun will come and see me if he needs anything.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.716
I don't want to remind him

16:03.740 --> 16:05.650
that he can make use of me, right?

16:06.360 --> 16:07.326
You boy.

16:07.350 --> 16:09.190
You're finally smart.

16:10.880 --> 16:11.726
Sister.

16:11.750 --> 16:14.470
How did you braid my hair today?

16:14.600 --> 16:17.086
Xiaoyu's hair is not long enough.

16:17.110 --> 16:20.576
It needs to grow longer to be braided into styles.

16:20.600 --> 16:24.346
So remember to eat well

16:24.370 --> 16:25.836
and sleep well.

16:25.860 --> 16:27.930
Then your hair can grow faster.

16:28.420 --> 16:30.196
Then I need to grow up quickly

16:30.220 --> 16:31.876
and grow my hair.

16:31.900 --> 16:34.520
I still want Sister Shu to braid my hair.

16:39.720 --> 16:41.410
Xiaoyu is the best.

16:41.550 --> 16:43.480
Xiaoyu was the first one here.

16:43.560 --> 16:45.566
You and Jiabao should take care of

16:45.590 --> 16:47.670
other brothers and sisters.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.026
Look at you.

16:51.050 --> 16:52.556
You're so thoughtful today.

16:52.580 --> 16:55.330
Let's build a swing in this yard.

16:55.530 --> 16:57.566
Take good care of the teacher as well.

16:57.590 --> 16:58.676
As long as he settles here,

16:58.700 --> 17:00.460
we can feel more assured.

17:00.830 --> 17:02.920
These children have undergone many hardships.

17:02.960 --> 17:06.129
The caretaker shouldn't change frequently.

17:08.219 --> 17:09.856
You only talk

17:09.880 --> 17:11.599
but you don't come and help out.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.406
Come on.

17:15.430 --> 17:17.349
Let's play cuju.

17:17.390 --> 17:18.840
Come on.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.370
Let's go.

17:21.700 --> 17:23.150
My turn. My turn.

17:37.510 --> 17:39.230
Pass it to me.

17:55.930 --> 17:59.450
Sister went to the Jishan Hall to help.

17:59.900 --> 18:01.350
Jishan Hall?

18:01.860 --> 18:04.670
It's the new name of Jishan Hall.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.750
Jin named it.

18:08.580 --> 18:10.030
Good name.

18:11.630 --> 18:13.220
When did Yanan go there?

18:14.250 --> 18:17.040
About half past six.

18:21.570 --> 18:24.960
Does Master miss Miss?

18:27.630 --> 18:29.500
I know I shouldn't ask.

18:30.280 --> 18:31.840
But these days,

18:32.920 --> 18:34.730
why are Master and Miss

18:35.690 --> 18:38.690
always avoiding each other?

18:40.350 --> 18:41.696
No.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.520
We were together yesterday.

18:44.150 --> 18:45.750
Although you were together,

18:46.580 --> 18:48.260
you were emotionally distant.

18:56.550 --> 18:58.486
Master. Manager.

18:58.510 --> 19:00.046
There is a guest.

19:00.070 --> 19:02.100
It's obvious that she disguised herself as a man.

19:02.230 --> 19:04.960
She lost 1,000 taels within half an hour.

19:05.810 --> 19:07.350
She lost at every move.

19:08.610 --> 19:10.390
It seems she did it on purpose.

19:10.780 --> 19:12.330
I'm afraid she's here for trouble.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.890
Let's have a look.

19:18.450 --> 19:19.506
Sir, according to

19:19.530 --> 19:21.046
the rules of the Chamber of Commerce,

19:21.070 --> 19:23.976
we only accept silver taels or silver certificates.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.346
You...

19:25.370 --> 19:26.766
Ridiculous.

19:26.790 --> 19:29.320
How am I going to recoup my losses like this?

19:29.580 --> 19:30.826
Miss,

19:30.850 --> 19:32.800
I guess you're out of luck today.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.246
Why don't you come another day?

19:34.270 --> 19:35.606
Who are you?

19:35.630 --> 19:37.890
I'm the Master of Liansheng House.

19:39.190 --> 19:40.640
Master?

19:48.300 --> 19:50.740
[King Fu's Family should not be interfered in and out of the palace when being on duty]

19:56.350 --> 19:58.596
If Liansheng House wins this jade pendant,

19:58.620 --> 20:01.120
I'm afraid I'll end up in prison.

20:01.730 --> 20:03.820
Please show mercy, Your Highness.

20:04.970 --> 20:07.026
My name is not written on it.

20:07.050 --> 20:08.760
How did you know?

20:16.140 --> 20:17.686
Since you already know who I am,

20:17.710 --> 20:19.546
how dare you talk to me like that?

20:19.570 --> 20:22.210
What if you'll be penalised for being disrespectful?

20:23.550 --> 20:24.806
Sir,

20:24.830 --> 20:26.410
would you like to

20:26.490 --> 20:28.060
have a chat upstairs?

20:34.540 --> 20:37.860
Since Young Master Xiang of Nandu invited me personally,

20:38.220 --> 20:39.940
I won't refuse.

20:44.130 --> 20:45.006
Come on.

20:45.030 --> 20:46.480
Let's go on.

20:52.650 --> 20:54.100
Enjoy.

21:06.490 --> 21:07.940
Tell me.

21:08.580 --> 21:10.710
How did you know who I was?

21:11.000 --> 21:13.850
King Fu is known for being loyal to love.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.160
When Her Highness was severely ill,

21:16.420 --> 21:19.100
King Fu swore to never marry again.

21:19.590 --> 21:21.210
He kept his promise until now.

21:22.010 --> 21:23.910
Just now I saw "King Fu's Family",

21:23.990 --> 21:26.090
which was carved on the jade pendant.

21:26.180 --> 21:27.630
As far as I know,

21:28.110 --> 21:30.330
the princess is the only female figure

21:30.930 --> 21:33.300
in King Fu's family.

21:33.350 --> 21:34.586
How dare you peasant

21:34.610 --> 21:37.050
talk about the royal family affairs?

21:37.430 --> 21:39.086
I dare not.

21:39.110 --> 21:41.270
I just want to answer your question.

21:41.790 --> 21:43.696
Will you answer

21:43.720 --> 21:45.280
anything I ask you with honesty?

21:45.510 --> 21:46.960
Of course.

21:48.510 --> 21:50.126
What's your relationship

21:50.150 --> 21:51.600
with that female manager?

21:53.520 --> 21:55.520
She is the manager of Liansheng House.

21:55.860 --> 21:57.750
I'm the Master of Liansheng House.

21:58.080 --> 21:59.530
That's all.

22:06.930 --> 22:10.260
Is Your Highness satisfied with my answer?

22:11.310 --> 22:12.760
Sit down.

22:12.870 --> 22:14.320
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:26.210 --> 22:27.880
Don't say thank you.

22:28.100 --> 22:29.580
Apologize to me first.

22:30.040 --> 22:31.806
I came to visit you.

22:31.830 --> 22:33.666
But several pages told me

22:33.690 --> 22:36.010
Mr. Yun never meets guests.

22:38.520 --> 22:40.120
Now I understand.

22:41.010 --> 22:43.530
If Your Highness only wins and never loses,

22:43.840 --> 22:46.970
you'll probably be treated as a cheater and get evicted.

22:47.250 --> 22:49.860
But Your Highness only loses and never wins.

22:50.310 --> 22:53.250
Your Highness spent a lot of money and had no intention to stop.

22:54.010 --> 22:55.766
Such an unusual guest

22:55.790 --> 22:58.220
will surely arouse the suspicion of the Master.

22:58.330 --> 23:00.986
You lost 1,000 taels in a row

23:01.010 --> 23:03.080
solely to draw me out.

23:03.300 --> 23:05.910
You are indeed smart and sharp.

23:08.300 --> 23:10.290
As expected of Yun Xiang.

23:10.390 --> 23:13.530
In just over a month, you've become famous.

23:13.700 --> 23:15.400
You're indeed quite clever.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.580
But I still don't understand.

23:17.940 --> 23:20.250
Why did you want to use this badge

23:20.270 --> 23:21.720
as collateral?

23:21.910 --> 23:25.500
If I hadn't found out in time,

23:25.750 --> 23:27.890
I'm afraid I'd be in big trouble.

23:28.190 --> 23:30.700
But no one has ever asked me to wait for an hour.

23:31.660 --> 23:33.256
I wanted to teach you a lesson,

23:33.280 --> 23:34.866
but you were lucky.

23:34.890 --> 23:36.370
You came at the right time.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.170
I see.

23:39.470 --> 23:41.316
Am I questioning you? Or are you questioning me?

23:41.340 --> 23:42.790
I dare not.

23:43.400 --> 23:47.130
I think Your Highness has a prestigious status.

23:47.160 --> 23:49.176
It's too risky

23:49.200 --> 23:50.970
to come here alone.

23:52.260 --> 23:55.060
I wonder if Lord Liu came with you.

23:59.110 --> 24:03.150
Why did Mr. Yun follow the pleasure boat last night?

24:10.030 --> 24:11.306
It must be

24:11.330 --> 24:15.226
because of the money in the boat.

24:15.250 --> 24:17.610
As for the robbery of official silver,

24:17.670 --> 24:21.530
it must be related to Mo Bufan, Mr. Yun's friend.

24:23.080 --> 24:25.570
Your Highness really came prepared.

24:26.000 --> 24:27.756
I also heard from Magistrate Shao

24:27.780 --> 24:29.840
the official silver stolen a few days ago

24:29.860 --> 24:31.870
was paid back by Mr. Su.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.810
Yun Xiang,

24:33.910 --> 24:36.830
how many accomplices do you have in Nandu?

24:37.800 --> 24:39.726
The female manager

24:39.750 --> 24:41.950
doesn't seem to have an affair with you.

24:42.250 --> 24:44.460
Is she also your accomplice?

24:48.420 --> 24:49.870
Your Highness.

24:50.110 --> 24:51.630
She's not my accomplice.

24:51.810 --> 24:54.826
We're just friends in business.

24:54.850 --> 24:56.410
Enough with the excuses.

24:56.510 --> 24:57.546
Yun Xiang,

24:57.570 --> 24:59.510
it's better if you tell me now.

24:59.590 --> 25:01.450
If my uncle comes,

25:01.730 --> 25:03.580
you might not be able to survive.

25:17.310 --> 25:18.760
Remember.

25:18.800 --> 25:21.326
Yun Xiang is not an ordinary person.

25:21.350 --> 25:23.166
He won't use ordinary means.

25:23.190 --> 25:25.550
I understand. As usual.

25:25.650 --> 25:27.600
My lord is the good cop. I'll be the bad cop.

25:44.400 --> 25:45.806
Go upstairs and help.

25:45.830 --> 25:48.060
Prepare the tea and dessert.

25:48.090 --> 25:49.870
Be considerate and treat them well.

25:55.620 --> 25:57.070
Girl.

26:01.190 --> 26:02.640
Sir.

26:03.270 --> 26:05.440
Is Mr. Yun here?

26:05.640 --> 26:07.396
Mr. Yun is receiving his guest.

26:07.420 --> 26:09.366
He specially asked us not to disturb him.

26:09.390 --> 26:11.690
What kind of special guest?

26:12.150 --> 26:13.730
Lead us the way.

26:24.080 --> 26:25.750
If you keep barging in,

26:26.560 --> 26:27.816
I'll tell the officials.

26:27.840 --> 26:29.290
Move.

26:31.200 --> 26:32.286
This is the place.

26:32.310 --> 26:33.760
Move.

26:35.500 --> 26:36.950
Move.

27:11.020 --> 27:13.130
Uncle, I'll leave this to you.

27:23.140 --> 27:24.590
Leave now.

27:29.590 --> 27:30.756
Your Highness.

27:30.780 --> 27:31.686
My lord said it last time that

27:31.710 --> 27:33.956
you can't get involved in these things.

27:33.980 --> 27:35.290
I just wanted to help you

27:35.310 --> 27:37.100
get more information

27:37.710 --> 27:38.886
and close the case as soon as possible.

27:38.910 --> 27:40.550
I want to solve these disputes.

27:41.790 --> 27:42.750
I don't want to see anybody

27:42.750 --> 27:44.760
die in front of me again.

27:48.180 --> 27:49.630
Good evening, Lord Liu.

27:58.340 --> 28:00.450
Since you know who I am,

28:00.760 --> 28:02.596
let's be honest with each other.

28:02.620 --> 28:04.070
Don't beat around the bush.

28:05.110 --> 28:06.436
Good.

28:06.460 --> 28:07.910
In that case,

28:08.220 --> 28:09.860
do you admit to committing the crime?

28:10.200 --> 28:11.720
I didn't report the information.

28:11.910 --> 28:14.510
According to the law, I will be caned 30 times.

28:16.950 --> 28:20.306
So it was indeed you

28:20.330 --> 28:21.970
who followed me yesterday.

28:23.680 --> 28:25.660
Do you have wine, Mr. Yun?

28:29.500 --> 28:31.090
To be honest,

28:31.360 --> 28:33.990
compared to the bandits of Lingyuan Sect,

28:34.110 --> 28:36.970
I hate those hypocrites of Yuntai Sect more.

28:38.550 --> 28:40.030
I'm all ears.

28:49.030 --> 28:50.366
Lingyuan Sect

28:50.390 --> 28:52.110
is just a bunch of bandits.

28:52.170 --> 28:53.800
They're calling for the resurgence of orthodoxy.

28:53.820 --> 28:56.020
In fact, it's for power.

28:56.290 --> 28:58.940
It's for the position above all people.

29:00.520 --> 29:02.036
It's the same with Yuntai Sect,

29:02.060 --> 29:03.616
but they pretend to be sanctimonious.

29:03.640 --> 29:06.440
They retreated and hid away from the city.

29:07.440 --> 29:09.890
How pathetic.

29:10.400 --> 29:13.276
If they are talented, why won't they work as officials?

29:13.300 --> 29:17.200
To serve the people in the rightful way.

29:18.700 --> 29:22.910
You can't cross a river without being covered in mud.

29:23.970 --> 29:27.580
Yuntai's people are used to maintaining their integrity.

29:29.750 --> 29:33.666
The officialdom is full of uncertainties.

29:33.690 --> 29:35.290
A mix of good and evil.

29:35.400 --> 29:37.380
But it is the officialdom.

29:37.870 --> 29:40.110
Humans are hard to predict. Both good and bad exist.

29:40.110 --> 29:43.076
The only thing we can rely on is the law.

29:43.100 --> 29:44.106
I hate Yuntai

29:44.130 --> 29:46.930
because they claim to be superior.

29:47.510 --> 29:49.510
How could they be above the law

29:49.640 --> 29:51.600
because of maintaining the integrity?

29:53.830 --> 29:55.900
What do you think, Mr. Yun?

29:58.790 --> 30:02.150
The world is so complicated.

30:02.600 --> 30:04.690
Who is cleaner than who?

30:06.110 --> 30:08.326
I'm talking to you about Yuntai Sect.

30:08.350 --> 30:12.236
Yuntai's people are also people of the world.

30:12.260 --> 30:13.526
Wrong.

30:13.550 --> 30:15.210
No matter if you are in the officialdom or not,

30:15.230 --> 30:17.436
there will be a river in front of you.

30:17.460 --> 30:19.450
You must cross it to survive.

30:19.580 --> 30:21.500
If you managed to cross it,

30:21.800 --> 30:24.290
you might be covered in mud.

30:26.970 --> 30:29.136
If you know you're covered in mud,

30:29.160 --> 30:30.870
you're at least honest.

30:31.180 --> 30:34.590
If you still pretend to be pure and innocent,

30:35.580 --> 30:37.780
that would be really dirty.

30:46.910 --> 30:48.360
Yuntai Sect.

30:49.140 --> 30:51.240
It's dirty.

30:57.030 --> 30:59.470
If you have something to say, say it now.

31:00.270 --> 31:02.710
Otherwise, you won't have a chance

31:03.510 --> 31:05.340
in the government dungeon.

31:11.940 --> 31:13.390
To be honest,

31:14.520 --> 31:16.460
even if Lord Liu didn't come tonight,

31:17.180 --> 31:20.880
I would have visited you tomorrow morning.

31:23.330 --> 31:24.780
Nothing else.

31:25.000 --> 31:28.280
I just want to make a deal with you.

31:29.940 --> 31:33.166
A deal between Yuntai and imperial guards.

31:33.190 --> 31:37.150
It's a deal between Lord Liu and me.

31:38.620 --> 31:40.696
I'm willing to do my best to help you

31:40.720 --> 31:44.410
solve the water ghost robbery case.

31:47.670 --> 31:49.120
Indeed.

31:50.500 --> 31:52.890
With the ability of the best Detective of Jiangnan.

31:53.330 --> 31:56.780
it's not difficult to catch

31:57.260 --> 31:58.830
some fleeing towboat soldiers.

31:58.910 --> 32:00.566
But if you leave it to me,

32:00.590 --> 32:03.666
I will get it done within three days.

32:03.690 --> 32:05.930
And my offer is simple.

32:06.500 --> 32:09.770
I just need to be exempted from the 30 canes.

32:12.190 --> 32:13.576
In that case,

32:13.600 --> 32:16.150
you'd better follow me to the government office.

32:20.140 --> 32:22.690
Don't force me to arrest you.

32:23.190 --> 32:26.550
You think this is an insignificant deal.

32:30.870 --> 32:32.576
If you make a deal with strangers,

32:32.600 --> 32:35.020
we have to start small.

32:35.680 --> 32:37.390
We need to gain trust

32:39.560 --> 32:41.160
and strengthen our relationship.

32:43.150 --> 32:47.230
Then there will be big business.

33:03.460 --> 33:05.620
You're very eloquent.

33:12.590 --> 33:14.040
Yun Xiang, the crime you committed

33:14.950 --> 33:17.950
is more than not reporting the information.

33:18.150 --> 33:20.830
After you entered the city,

33:20.960 --> 33:23.436
you caused constant chaos in the business world.

33:23.460 --> 33:26.846
You also colluded with Mo Bufan from Guanghui Bank.

33:26.870 --> 33:29.360
You're suspected of colluding with the pirates.

33:29.630 --> 33:31.410
All of them.

33:31.780 --> 33:34.140
Every one of them is a capital crime.

33:46.010 --> 33:48.380
All the land belongs to the emperor.

33:48.830 --> 33:52.400
Our imperial guards are the eyes of the emperor.

33:52.940 --> 33:55.046
Do you really think you can hide

33:55.070 --> 33:56.990
what you did from the world?

34:00.050 --> 34:01.780
Since you came into the city,

34:03.180 --> 34:05.430
you didn't try your best to arrest the robbers.

34:06.140 --> 34:08.550
Instead, you kept an eye on me.

34:09.779 --> 34:11.330
At first, I thought

34:12.379 --> 34:15.590
you wanted to use me to lead the way

34:15.830 --> 34:17.560
and take advantage of it.

34:18.480 --> 34:20.979
Compared to arresting the bandits of Lingyuan Sect,

34:21.080 --> 34:23.019
I'm more curious

34:23.080 --> 34:25.570
why you are always against them.

34:27.120 --> 34:28.906
Since you can go against them,

34:28.930 --> 34:32.870
you should have greater leverage.

34:33.240 --> 34:34.959
So you're sure

34:35.190 --> 34:37.396
you can find more clues

34:37.420 --> 34:39.310
about Lingyuan from me.

34:40.819 --> 34:44.310
To this point, I should be honest with you.

34:46.710 --> 34:49.290
I can let you go for now.

34:49.940 --> 34:51.820
But you and I

34:52.560 --> 34:56.150
should make a real value deal.

35:10.760 --> 35:13.150
Did you catch them alive

35:13.520 --> 35:15.340
when you suddenly attacked the boat?

35:16.930 --> 35:20.690
The bandits of Lingyuan would rather die than surrender.

35:21.220 --> 35:23.016
We only caught a few silversmiths

35:23.040 --> 35:25.320
who were tricked onto the boat.

35:26.820 --> 35:28.416
According to Lingyuan's way,

35:28.440 --> 35:31.150
it's impossible for the silversmiths to know the truth.

35:31.890 --> 35:34.050
So there is no way to prove it.

35:34.110 --> 35:35.890
But do you suspect

35:36.030 --> 35:38.100
that this water ghost robbery case

35:38.180 --> 35:40.926
could be fabricated into a mystery?

35:40.950 --> 35:42.080
The robbers have secretly shipped

35:42.100 --> 35:44.750
official ingots back to the inner lake of Nandu.

35:44.830 --> 35:46.950
As long as the money sank,

35:47.370 --> 35:49.610
the case would be closed.

35:50.010 --> 35:52.430
But they chose to melt silver and sell the stolen goods.

35:52.730 --> 35:54.446
That's why they left a loophole.

35:54.470 --> 35:56.500
Maybe it wasn't because of money.

35:57.130 --> 35:59.180
What if they did it intentionally?

36:00.580 --> 36:01.606
Go on.

36:01.630 --> 36:04.206
Recently, strange things have happened in Nandu.

36:04.230 --> 36:08.266
Everything is related to Lingyuan Sect.

36:08.290 --> 36:11.560
The connection is quite subtle.

36:11.790 --> 36:13.176
For example,

36:13.200 --> 36:14.526
why don't you and I start

36:14.550 --> 36:16.296
investigating those fleeing soldiers?

36:16.320 --> 36:19.710
I will explain everything to you during this time.

36:22.380 --> 36:23.830
My Lord.

36:24.050 --> 36:26.400
You are an official and I am a civilian.

36:26.530 --> 36:28.846
Even if the deal is over,

36:28.870 --> 36:30.500
and you want to target me,

36:31.100 --> 36:32.836
I can only surrender.

36:32.860 --> 36:34.326
I can't escape even if I have wings.

36:34.350 --> 36:35.926
That means

36:35.950 --> 36:37.456
you're sure that this deal

36:37.480 --> 36:39.430
will change my view towards Yuntai?

36:39.430 --> 36:40.880
I dare not.

36:41.820 --> 36:43.790
This has nothing to do with Yuntai.

36:44.150 --> 36:46.720
It's just a deal between you and me.

36:46.980 --> 36:49.246
Since you came here in person

36:49.270 --> 36:51.190
to talk to me late at night,

36:51.350 --> 36:53.806
I believe you agree with me.

36:53.830 --> 36:55.300
In that case,

36:55.470 --> 36:58.510
I will not let you down.

37:11.390 --> 37:12.840
Girl,

37:13.410 --> 37:14.860
are you going somewhere?

37:16.230 --> 37:17.986
Why do you ask?

37:18.010 --> 37:19.906
You sounded like

37:19.930 --> 37:22.140
you were planning for your afterlife.

37:22.200 --> 37:23.346
No, no, no.

37:23.370 --> 37:25.910
It seemed like you were saying goodbye to us.

37:27.490 --> 37:29.820
Don't be so sentimental.

37:30.240 --> 37:33.146
Did the kids make your heart soft

37:33.170 --> 37:35.696
or did Tianhu make you smart?

37:35.720 --> 37:37.456
No, no.

37:37.480 --> 37:39.996
You and Miss Ke, don't see us like that.

37:40.020 --> 37:41.470
You...

37:41.890 --> 37:43.320
You're clearly thinking about it,

37:43.340 --> 37:44.870
but you don't allow others to say it.

37:44.910 --> 37:47.646
Didn't you return to Liansheng House for Tianhu?

37:47.670 --> 37:49.790
Was it for Yun Xiang?

37:51.570 --> 37:52.446
Goodbye, sir.

37:52.470 --> 37:53.686
No.

37:53.710 --> 37:55.160
I...

37:56.590 --> 37:58.230
Girl, you pinched me.

38:00.220 --> 38:02.046
- Don't talk to me.
- Uncle, wait for me.

38:01.620 --> 38:03.790
[Liansheng House]

38:05.630 --> 38:07.696
What did you promise me that day?

38:07.720 --> 38:09.686
How could you meet the suspect alone?

38:09.710 --> 38:11.370
You've been working hard lately.

38:11.390 --> 38:12.630
I want to share your burden.

38:12.630 --> 38:14.190
What was the result?

38:15.650 --> 38:17.846
You grew up in a high wall and deep courtyard.

38:17.870 --> 38:20.646
Everyone is respectful to you.

38:20.670 --> 38:23.606
But there is the martial world outside the walls.

38:23.630 --> 38:26.206
People don't live by the rules you know.

38:26.230 --> 38:27.990
Your princess identity couldn't protect you,

38:28.010 --> 38:30.690
and could even put you in more danger.

38:30.890 --> 38:32.606
But as you said,

38:32.630 --> 38:34.926
people in Yuntai are not evil.

38:34.950 --> 38:37.680
- That's why I…
- Do you believe anything I say?

38:40.210 --> 38:42.740
Can't I believe what you've said?

38:44.970 --> 38:46.620
I just hope

38:46.790 --> 38:49.350
Your Highness could be more careful

38:49.990 --> 38:51.940
and protect yourself.

38:52.960 --> 38:54.040
Okay, I got it.

38:54.060 --> 38:55.540
I got it.

38:56.190 --> 38:58.070
Uncle, don't be angry.

38:59.450 --> 39:00.426
My lord,

39:00.450 --> 39:02.030
what should we do with Yun Xiang?

39:03.030 --> 39:05.476
It's hard to tell if he's good or bad. Not an ordinary man.

39:05.500 --> 39:06.950
Just wait.

39:07.560 --> 39:15.860
[Liansheng House]

39:08.150 --> 39:10.346
Let the man

39:10.370 --> 39:12.000
create turmoil to the world.

39:13.280 --> 39:14.686
I'm going out of the city tomorrow.

39:14.710 --> 39:16.056
Li Bo will be with you.

39:16.080 --> 39:18.440
Just take a rest in the villa.

39:23.840 --> 39:25.356
Judging from your look,

39:25.380 --> 39:27.570
your enemy is here.

39:27.970 --> 39:29.800
It would be easier if they were enemies.

39:30.270 --> 39:32.710
That is Liu Gongquan, the Detective of Jiangnan.
